1db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"IDC：NVIDIA在华数据中心AI芯片份额降至34%","summary":"IDC报告显示，2026年上半年NVIDIA在中国数据中心AI芯片市场的份额降至34%，AI加速器出货量为67.8万颗，同比下降44%。华为AI加速器出货量增至57.2万颗，占整体市场28%；IDC追踪的11家中国芯片制造商中有9家出货量同比增长。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295876","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:53.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"qybbdj76ava29ryaygqx04pwt"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anza 定于 10 月 21 日启动 Solana Alpenglow 主网升级","summary":"Solana 开发团队 Anza 计划于美国东部时间 10 月 21 日上午约 10:50 启动 Alpenglow 主网 Beta 迁移，以新的共识系统取代 TowerBFT。Alpenglow 目标是将交易最终确认时间缩短至约 150 毫秒，而 TowerBFT 下的最终确认时间约为 12.8 秒；其 Votor 投票协议通过验证者间直接通信并聚合证书，区块在一到两轮投票后即可最终确认。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295990","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T15:23:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"aemfllkqbl8aco6w56qm1owr5"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Ethereum NFT 市场 Blur 将于 11 月 12 日关闭网站","summary":"Blur 宣布将于 11 月 12 日关闭 NFT 市场网站，并停止通过 Blend 安排新贷款，但其在 Ethereum 上的智能合约仍将运行。该平台月交易量从 2023 年 3 月约 $1.43 billion 降至 2026 年 3 月不足 $7 million，跌幅超过 99.5%，BLUR 在公告后下跌超过 20%。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/13/once-largest-ethereum-nft-marketplace-blur-is-shutting-down-after-volumes-collapse-99","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T04:43:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"ggjnaix5subfrnyi4chf96gd4"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"高盛Q3净营收186.8亿美元，股票交易收入增长72%","summary":"高盛第三季度净营收同比增长23%至186.8亿美元，净利润增长29%至53亿美元，股票交易收入增长72%至64.4亿美元。投行业务收入增长21%，资产管理费收入创历史新高，但FICC收入同比下降近1%至34.7亿美元。高盛受管资产规模达到4.097万亿美元，并完成对NEOS Investments和LCN Capital Partners的收购。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783543","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:26:32.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"yv0ijvali4tu6zglz3o4sd5gu"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"IMF：代币化 RWA 市场规模约 650 亿美元，或成杠杆积累与流动性风险新渠道","summary":"IMF 10 月《全球金融稳定报告》专门讨论代币化市场，显示截至 7 月底，不含回购和稳定币的代币化 RWA 公开市场规模约 650 亿美元。其中国信贷约 304 亿美元、货币市场基金约 175 亿美元、股票约 23 亿美元；代币化回购 30 日平均日交易量达 3030 亿美元。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295996","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T15:42:37.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"mig1ld111c3inyifw5bcs7w0b"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Coinbase 联创 Fred Ehrsam 押注委内瑞拉石油，创立 Primavera 接管多处油田","summary":"Coinbase 联合创始人 Fred Ehrsam 正以个人资金押注委内瑞拉石油产业，并通过其创立的 Primavera 与委内瑞拉国有石油公司 PDVSA 签署多项合同。Primavera 正筹备接管多个油田的运营，并聘请来自 Chevron 和 Occidental Petroleum 的资深人士建设基础设施，以支持常规石油和重质原油生产。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295970","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T13:29:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"stgexza66ctonzeiqd4xwzh5t"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"日本央行或在10月暂缓加息，12月加息概率升至88%","summary":"据彭博援引知情人士，日本央行倾向于在10月会议暂缓加息，但将根据经济数据评估12月是否再次加息。市场定价显示，日本央行10月加息概率约为10%，12月升至88%；美元兑日元报158.13。日本央行将于10月30日召开政策会议，评估油价上涨和食品销售税下调对通胀前景的影响。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783538","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:24:12.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"vzob2o5hyfb1qk252txo61ijq"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"韩国封锁包括KuCoin、BitMart和MEXC在内的27家加密交易所网站","summary":"韩国金融情报局宣布封锁27家未注册加密交易所的网站，包括KuCoin、BitMart和MEXC，进一步限制韩国投资者访问海外交易平台。海外运营的网站将被屏蔽，境内运营平台将被终止服务；交易所须向金融情报局注册并满足安全与反洗钱要求，监管机构还提醒用户核查平台资质并提取资产。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/13/south-korea-blocks-27-crypto-exchanges-including-bitmart-and-kucoin","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:58:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"mu7s2zk0leyf0jnbgjht2pt93"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"IMF警告债务与通胀风险可能引发主权债券收益率失序上升","summary":"IMF在最新《全球金融稳定报告》中警告，政府债券收益率可能因通胀上升、债务增加和 AI 相关借贷压力而出现失序式上涨。报告称，全球公共债务接近二战以来高位，并将很快超过 GDP 的100%；自2024年以来，超大规模科技公司的全球投资级债券发行占比已从不足1%升至10%。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/13/treasury-yields-imf-debt-inflation-.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T03:19:43.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"k3xtynsto2ygy5rxfmpd8o98m"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":11,"firstPartyEvents":9},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-13","next":"2026-10-15"}